A Thanksgiving for the Lord's-day.
BLESSED and Glorious Lord God, the Creator, and Preserver, and Governor of all Things, my Saviour and Deliverer, and continual Benefactor, I acknowledge, I admire; I adore Thy Infinite Excellencies and Perfections; and let all the Creatures in Heaven and Earth say Amen. Blessed and Hallowed be Thy holy Name for all Thy Meries over all Thy Works, in particular to the Children of Men; to the Christian Church by the Gospel Revelation and Covenant; to this Church and Nation, for its Light and Liberty, its Proficiency and Defence; for all good Magistrates and Ministers in Church and State, from the highest to the lowest;
